{"id": "item-ug9fcwbx", "text": "Invitations sent to valid addresses never arrive, although the system says delivered. We need the invitation delivery fixed."}
{"id": "item-7humyrua", "text": "The invite dialog functions properly, but people repeatedly mistake the cancel button for send. Please improve the visual hierarchy."}
{"id": "item-wyv8h9yc", "text": "Offline editing is already advertised, but reconnecting discards offline changes. Please repair the existing synchronization."}
{"id": "item-9d9bwg7p", "text": "I am not asking for another feature. I want the current feature included in the basic plan rather than sold as an add-on."}
{"id": "item-nbmd73aa", "text": "We need offline editing, which is not offered. Please add this capability for trips without internet."}
{"id": "item-e3s8sr8m", "text": "The existing version history is complete and correct, but its dates are difficult to scan. Please improve the layout."}
{"id": "item-98r6p46b", "text": "Could you add a connector for our inventory system? We currently copy the data manually because no connector exists."}
{"id": "item-ff2xwsqq", "text": "The error message says operation 47 failed. Please explain the issue and the next step in ordinary language."}
{"id": "item-twmg8m8t", "text": "Our saved report disappeared after we refreshed the page. We need saved work to survive a refresh."}
{"id": "item-k9a4zmgz", "text": "The editor duplicates the last paragraph whenever I reopen a saved document. Please stop changing the content."}
{"id": "item-6mq92ktf", "text": "The search results are correct, but the filter labels make no sense to new staff. Please rename them using terms our team understands."}
{"id": "item-dwx3gnmu", "text": "Please add a way to schedule recurring reports. At present reports can only be generated manually."}
{"id": "item-zqebtbxp", "text": "Please stop counting unaccepted invitations as paid seats. The charge policy is the issue."}
{"id": "item-4wc2bbhb", "text": "Please allow unused monthly credits to carry over rather than charging for a fresh allocation."}
{"id": "item-z2wegyjm", "text": "The import works, but the successful completion message appears far below the visible area. Please make the result easy to find."}
{"id": "item-c5w7ju5n", "text": "Please add an option to invite an entire group from a saved list; only individual invitations exist today."}
{"id": "item-2dhzkp3n", "text": "Please add version history so we can inspect prior drafts. The app currently keeps only the latest draft."}
{"id": "item-uak7mmzf", "text": "We need a new approval workflow with two reviewers; the product currently has no approval feature."}
{"id": "item-773tkkdb", "text": "Please make offline editing available on the current plan without requiring the higher-priced subscription."}
{"id": "item-yduyx9h4", "text": "Can you support importing contacts from a calendar service? That integration is not available today."}
{"id": "item-asevy7eh", "text": "It takes seven clicks to reach the existing export option. Please put a shortcut near the table."}
{"id": "item-bgyq2qwa", "text": "The file upload reports success but stores a zero-byte file. Please preserve the uploaded content."}
{"id": "item-t3dywf98", "text": "We need a monthly billing option; paying the entire year upfront is the problem, not the product behavior."}
{"id": "item-pxagepba", "text": "Version history claims to retain every draft but silently omits edits made offline. Please fix that data loss."}
{"id": "item-fwzt8fbf", "text": "The offline status is technically accurate, but the tiny icon is easy to miss. Please make connection state more obvious."}
{"id": "item-fykzw5yv", "text": "We use the product happily but need a cheaper annual plan for seasonal staff."}
{"id": "item-7ct9yue2", "text": "The per-seat surcharge makes our small volunteer team unable to afford the plan. Please change the seat pricing."}
{"id": "item-3ve6ensz", "text": "Notifications arrive hours after the event despite the stated immediate-delivery behavior. We need the existing alerts to work on time."}
{"id": "item-hwd3nz8c", "text": "The mobile app crashes when I open a perfectly valid attachment. Please fix the crash."}
{"id": "item-wwfxcqxx", "text": "Please introduce a dark theme. There is currently only a light theme and no display preference."}
{"id": "item-9343uavj", "text": "Everything works by mouse, but navigating the existing form with a keyboard takes an unnecessarily confusing route. Please improve the tab order."}
{"id": "item-6evcuzae", "text": "Version history is the only paid add-on we use. Could you lower its additional price?"}
